{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043080/extras/d757b99c9fa9568ae32a5b3b34860ab5.avif?t=1769047021\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043080/extras_big/d757b99c9fa9568ae32a5b3b34860ab5.webp?t=1769047021 width=1560 height=203 /></span>About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Whisker Kingdom, almost all cats have been turned into stone by the terrible <strong>Miaudusa</strong>. Now, only the young apprentices Nino and Nina can break the spell by preparing magical potions capable of bringing the petrified felines back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Miautem\u00e1gica</strong> is a cooperative game where math and teamwork blend into a cute and challenging adventure. Play with a friend and discover together how to use fractions and percentages to create the potions that will save the Whisker Kingdom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043080/extras/3742b0452dc95f69bb8ab37a8bf71c50.avif?t=1769047021\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043080/extras_big/3742b0452dc95f69bb8ab37a8bf71c50.webp?t=1769047021 width=1560 height=203 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cooperation is Key</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each potion is a unique challenge that demands communication and reasoning. One player handles fractions (solid ingredients), while the other masters percentages (liquid ingredients).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To complete the recipes, you will need to think fast, communicate, and get the measurements right. If you miss the measurements, your friends in the kingdom will be turned into cockroaches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043080/extras/52d376b0f96f71f52b204c02855671bb.avif?t=1769047021\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043080/extras_big/52d376b0f96f71f52b204c02855671bb.webp?t=1769047021 width=1560 height=203 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meowthmagic in Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Nino and Nina against the terrible <strong>Miaudusa</strong>, where learning happens in a light and fun way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for duo play, whether among friends, family, or even in the classroom, <strong>Miautem\u00e1gica</strong> transforms the study of fractions and percentages into a cooperative and enchanting experience.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tutorial","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4043080/01e749b4d4a6eef17eede62bfec1ea4c7b0fa23e.jpg"},{"name":"Five","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4043080/1cf12938806e5e8f885075f10edc5d6f42359de8.jpg"},{"name":"Ten","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4043080/c0c7d042d2942c2f374ee9b4b3c6e8363901f1cc.jpg"},{"name":"AllStars","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4043080/9e14a39d60704a4b5ff01d3118f8e5eed7823d1a.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4043080?t=1769047021","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043080/80c0e937445c498f468e160683bdd4306a9fbd05/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769047021","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043080/04c7fe8b9a43512fd7b1daa94ef520042dd3f0fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769047021","capsule_imag